  "summary": "licloud exfiltrates host identity to hardcoded bare-IP endpoint on install",
  "details": "setup.py collects the installer's OS name, username, and hostname and POSTs them via cleartext HTTP to the hardcoded bare-IP endpoint http://182.92.143.23/collect.php during `pip install`. The beacon fires unconditionally at install time. The shipped __init__.py has no functional code, so install-time transmission of installer identifiers to an author-controlled endpoint is the package's only observed behavior.",
